    "answer": {
      "short": "\\$715.49",
      "worked": "Rose works 4 hours on each of five weekdays, 2.5 hours on Saturday and 3 hours on Sunday.\n$$\\begin{align*}\n\\text{Normal hours} &= 5\\times4=20\\text{ h}\\\\\n\\text{Normal pay} &= 24.05\\times20=\\$481.00\\\\\n\\text{Saturday pay} &= 24.05\\times2.5\\times1.5=\\$90.1875\\\\\n\\text{Sunday pay} &= 24.05\\times3\\times2=\\$144.30\\\\\n\\text{Total pay} &= 481+90.1875+144.30\\\\\n\\text{Total pay} &= \\$715.4875\\approx\\$715.49\n\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
